e work on weekends and evenings.... READ MORE >> November 29, 2023 IT Help Desk Student Assistant Responsible for answering phones and email, maintaining the technology in labs and classrooms, and supporting students, faculty, and staff with a variety of technology needs.... READ MORE >> Randolph College is a private liberal arts college in Lynchburg, Virginia attracting students from Virginia, Maryland, North Carolina, and beyond. We provide a rigorous academic program that features small classes with top-ranked professors and hands-on, experiential learning. Employment Application Download PDF View Current Job Openings 2500 RIVERMONT AVE. LYNCHBURG, VA 24503 434-947-8000 CONTACT US RESOURCES FAST FACTS EMERGENCY INFO DISCLOSURE PRIVACY POLICY TITLE IX ON CAMPUS CALENDAR MAPS & DIRECTIONS CAMPUS STORE MAIER MUSEUM OF ART ENDSTATION THEATRE POPULAR LINKS A-Z INDEX PRESIDENT FINANCIAL AID EMPLOYMENT GRADUATE DEGREES FOLLOW US REQUEST ADMISSION INFO SCHEDULE A VISIT APPLY NOW GIVE TODAY"
